---@field LabelsInputConfiguration? aws.lookoutequipment.LabelsInputConfiguration Specifies configuration information about the labels input, including its S3 location.
---@field TrainingDataStartTime? aws.lookoutequipment.Timestamp Indicates the time reference in the dataset that was used to begin the subset of training data for the machine learning model.
---@field TrainingDataEndTime? aws.lookoutequipment.Timestamp Indicates the time reference in the dataset that was used to end the subset of training data for the machine learning model.
---@field EvaluationDataStartTime? aws.lookoutequipment.Timestamp Indicates the time reference in the dataset that was used to begin the subset of evaluation data for the machine learning model.
---@field EvaluationDataEndTime? aws.lookoutequipment.Timestamp Indicates the time reference in the dataset that was used to end the subset of evaluation data for the machine learning model.
---@field RoleArn? aws.lookoutequipment.IamRoleArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of a role with permission to access the data source for the machine learning model being described.
---@field DataPreProcessingConfiguration? aws.lookoutequipment.DataPreProcessingConfiguration The configuration is the TargetSamplingRate, which is the sampling rate of the data after post processing by Amazon Lookout for Equipment. For example, if you provide data that has been collected at a 1 second level and you want the system to resample the data at a 1 minute rate before training, the TargetSamplingRate is 1 minute.
---@field Status? aws.lookoutequipment.ModelStatus Specifies the current status of the model being described. Status describes the status of the most recent action of the model.
---@field TrainingExecutionStartTime? aws.lookoutequipment.Timestamp Indicates the time at which the training of the machine learning model began.
---@field TrainingExecutionEndTime? aws.lookoutequipment.Timestamp Indicates the time at which the training of the machine learning model was completed.
---@field FailedReason? aws.lookoutequipment.BoundedLengthString If the training of the machine learning model failed, this indicates the reason for that failure.
---@field ModelMetrics? aws.lookoutequipment.SynthesizedJsonModelMetrics The Model Metrics show an aggregated summary of the model's performance within the evaluation time range. This is the JSON content of the metrics created when evaluating the model.
---@field LastUpdatedTime? aws.lookoutequipment.Timestamp Indicates the last time the machine learning model was updated. The type of update is not specified.
---@field CreatedAt? aws.lookoutequipment.Timestamp Indicates the time and date at which the machine learning model was created.
---@field ServerSideKmsKeyId? aws.lookoutequipment.KmsKeyArn Provides the identifier of the KMS key used to encrypt model data by Amazon Lookout for Equipment.
---@field OffCondition? aws.lookoutequipment.OffCondition Indicates that the asset associated with this sensor has been shut off. As long as this condition is met, Lookout for Equipment will not use data from this asset for training, evaluation, or inference.
---@field SourceModelVersionArn? aws.lookoutequipment.ModelVersionArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the source model version. This field appears if the active model version was imported.
---@field ImportJobStartTime? aws.lookoutequipment.Timestamp The date and time when the import job was started. This field appears if the active model version was imported.
---@field ImportJobEndTime? aws.lookoutequipment.Timestamp The date and time when the import job was completed. This field appears if the active model version was imported.
---@field ActiveModelVersion? aws.lookoutequipment.ModelVersion The name of the model version used by the inference schedular when running a scheduled inference execution.
---@field ActiveModelVersionArn? aws.lookoutequipment.ModelVersionArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the model version used by the inference scheduler when running a scheduled inference execution.
---@field ModelVersionActivatedAt? aws.lookoutequipment.Timestamp The date the active model version was activated.
---@field PreviousActiveModelVersion? aws.lookoutequipment.ModelVersion The model version that was set as the active model version prior to the current active model version.
---@field PreviousActiveModelVersionArn? aws.lookoutequipment.ModelVersionArn The ARN of the model version that was set as the active model version prior to the current active model version.
---@field PreviousModelVersionActivatedAt? aws.lookoutequipment.Timestamp The date and time when the previous active model version was activated.
---@field PriorModelMetrics? aws.lookoutequipment.SynthesizedJsonModelMetrics If the model version was retrained, this field shows a summary of the performance of the prior model on the new training range. You can use the information in this JSON-formatted object to compare the new model version and the prior model version.
---@field LatestScheduledRetrainingFailedReason? aws.lookoutequipment.BoundedLengthString If the model version was generated by retraining and the training failed, this indicates the reason for that failure.
---@field LatestScheduledRetrainingStatus? aws.lookoutequipment.ModelVersionStatus Indicates the status of the most recent scheduled retraining run.
---@field LatestScheduledRetrainingModelVersion? aws.lookoutequipment.ModelVersion Indicates the most recent model version that was generated by retraining.
---@field LatestScheduledRetrainingStartTime? aws.lookoutequipment.Timestamp Indicates the start time of the most recent scheduled retraining run.
---@field LatestScheduledRetrainingAvailableDataInDays? aws.lookoutequipment.Integer Indicates the number of days of data used in the most recent scheduled retraining run.
---@field NextScheduledRetrainingStartDate? aws.lookoutequipment.Timestamp Indicates the date and time that the next scheduled retraining run will start on. Lookout for Equipment truncates the time you provide to the nearest UTC day.
---@field AccumulatedInferenceDataStartTime? aws.lookoutequipment.Timestamp Indicates the start time of the inference data that has been accumulated.
---@field AccumulatedInferenceDataEndTime? aws.lookoutequipment.Timestamp Indicates the end time of the inference data that has been accumulated.
---@field RetrainingSchedulerStatus? aws.lookoutequipment.RetrainingSchedulerStatus Indicates the status of the retraining scheduler.
---@field ModelDiagnosticsOutputConfiguration? aws.lookoutequipment.ModelDiagnosticsOutputConfiguration Configuration information for the model's pointwise model diagnostics.
---@field ModelQuality? aws.lookoutequipment.ModelQuality Provides a quality assessment for a model that uses labels. If Lookout for Equipment determines that the model quality is poor based on training metrics, the value is POOR_QUALITY_DETECTED. Otherwise, the value is QUALITY_THRESHOLD_MET.

